OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in collision involving
OL,4,Acar and lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man aged in his 30s has died after
OL,7,Fthe car he was driving was involved in
OL,8,Fa collision with a lorry.
OL,10,FThe A1067 in Norfolk was closed for
OL,11,Fmore than 13 hours following the crash
OL,12,Fnear Fakenham, close to the junction
OL,13,Fwith Little Snoring Road, at 15:00 GMT
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FA silver Vauxhall Corsa and a blue
OL,17,FScania lorry were involved, police
OL,18,Fsaid, with the driver of the Corsa
OL,19,Fdeclared dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
